{
    "_comment": [
        "Q2C Fan Architecture (confirmed from block diagram):",
        "  - The AST2600 BMC is on the SCM (System Control Module) board.",
        "  - 4 fan connectors on the carrier board: Fan0..Fan3.",
        "  - Fans are NOT driven directly by AST2600 PWM hardware.",
        "  - A Fan Expander Board (schematic pg 59) is controlled via I2C",
        "    (SDA_FAN_EXP / SCL_FAN_EXP) from the SCM board.",
        "  - Fan expander chip model and I2C address: see SCM board schematic.",
        "  - writePath values below are PLACEHOLDERS — update after driver bringup.",
        "Temperature sensors used as PID inputs:",
        "  - Inlet_Temp / Outlet_Temp: LM75 sensors on SCM board (block diagram)",
        "  - Board_Temp_0: carrier board LM75#0 (schematic LM75#0_TEMP_ALERT_L pg 34)",
        "  - Board_Temp_1: carrier board LM75#1",
        "  - Board_Temp_2: carrier board LM75#2"
    ],
